  description: "While this card is in your GY, if a \"Salamangreat\" Link Monster
    you control leaves the field because of an opponent's card effect (except during
    the Damage Step): You can Special Summon 2 Level 4 \"Salamangreat\" monsters
    from your GY, including this card, but negate their effects, and if you do, immediately
    after this effect resolves, Xyz Summon 1 \"Salamangreat\" Xyz Monster, using
    only those 2 monsters. You can only use this effect of \"Salamangreat Zebroid
    X\" once per turn. An Xyz Monster that was Summoned using this card on the field
    as material gains this effect.\r\n\u25CF This card gains 300 ATK for each material
    attached to it."
